                "message": "Fix sp-author-notes-bibtex freezing Emacs on large .bib files\n\nIndex the entries by author name once instead of comparing every author\nnote with every author of every entry; a missing .bib file now gives a\nuser-error or a message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9HDQBXXdZ9XpEdeVx",
